+Each request renews the session for the expiry interval set by `EXPIRY_MINUTES` in
+[`larder/sessions.py`](../../larder/sessions.py).
+
+## Known limits
+
+Members packing a pantry order on a slow mobile connection may be logged out before they confirm it and lose what
+they picked. The previous 10-minute limit caused 120 support tickets in March 2024; raising it to 30 minutes ended
+those tickets. The limit is now shortened again to log members out sooner. Members must confirm their order before
+the session expires to avoid losing their selections.
 
